{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04464","headline":"春晦饯陶七於江南同用风字 · 陈子昂","name":"春晦饯陶七於江南同用风字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黄鹤烟云去，青江琴酒同。\n离帆方楚越，沟水复西东。\n芙蓉生夏浦，杨柳送春风。\n明日相思处，应对菊花丛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04464.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04464","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}